## 🎯 Purpose of This Documentation
This runbook is designed for **Junior Developers and DevOps trainees** to independently build, verify, troubleshoot, and tear down an **Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)** cluster on AWS[cite: 2, 4, 5]. 

In addition to the step-by-step setup commands, this guide documents **4 common real-world errors** that beginners encounter on AWS Free Tier accounts and Ubuntu EC2 jump servers—and exactly how to fix them without starting over from scratch.

